config AIC_SOC_D21X
    bool
    default n
    help
        Builds the D21x SoC layer (D213/D21x register map, clock and reset
        tables, and the vendor HAL selected by the board options).  Selected
        by D21x boards; other SoC families provide their own layer.

config AIC_USING_HAL_I2C
    bool
    default n
    help
        Builds the shared I2C v1.0 HAL from libraries/hal/i2c.  Selected by
        BSP_USING_I2Cn on SoCs whose I2C controller is register-compatible.

config AIC_USING_DRV_I2C
    bool
    default n
    select AIC_USING_HAL_I2C
    help
        Builds the RT-Thread I2C master adapter from libraries/drivers/i2c.
        The adapter calls hal_i2c_* and uses the I2Cx_BASE/I2Cx_IRQn/CLK_I2Cx
        constants supplied by the selected SoC layer, so a board only needs
        to provide those constants and BSP_USING_I2Cn.
